  {
   "block_type": "Text",
   "content": "<p>This report covers the refurbishment, servicing, component replacement, cleaning, inspection, and functional restoration carried out at the TSL Electronics Services LLC workshop. The work included:</p><ul><li>Complete dismantling and detailed internal inspection of the unit.</li><li>Replacement of all identified weak, faulty, and out-of-tolerance passive electronic components.</li><li>Comprehensive cleaning of all internal PCB assemblies, busbars, cooling paths, and enclosure.</li><li>Electrical inspection, verification testing, and functional restoration.</li><li>Final operational testing carried out, confirming the unit is functioning correctly and ready for service.</li></ul>"
  },
